    <string name="code_settings_setup_title">Setting up a machine</string>
    <string name="code_settings_setup_body">1. Install the GradatiON bridge on the machine that has your agents and code.\n2. Start it and copy the address and pairing token it prints.\n3. Reach it privately: same Wi-Fi, Tailscale, or an SSH tunnel. Never expose it to the open internet.\n4. Add it here, pick an agent and a folder, and send a task.\n\nThe bridge is not published yet. Until it is, the demo machine shows how everything works.</string>
    <string name="code_host_demo_sub">Built in. Scripted sessions, nothing leaves the phone</string>

